---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Bexley Watchdog -- reviews on roofers, plumbers, and tradesmen in Erith and Bexley.">
	<main class="shell">
		<PageHeader kicker="About" title="About Bexley Watchdog" />
		<div class="post-body">
			<p>Bexley Watchdog is a small, independent collection of reviews on roofers, plumbers, and tradesmen working in Erith and Bexley.</p>
			<p>Everything here is first-hand: jobs commissioned, work carried out (or not), and money paid, written up honestly after the fact. Some posts are warnings about tradespeople who took money and didn&#8217;t deliver. Others are positive call-outs for people who did a good, honest job and deserve the work.</p>
			<p>There&#8217;s no advertising here and nobody pays to be featured or removed. The aim is simply to help other local homeowners avoid the same bad experiences, and find the tradespeople worth trusting.</p>
			<p>This site was previously hosted on WordPress.com and has since been migrated to a static site with no database or CMS to maintain.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	main.shell {
		--shell-max-width: 720px;
	}

	.post-body {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--text);
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.post-body :global(p) {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-body);
	}

	.post-body :global(a) {
		color: var(--accent-strong);
	}
</style>
